{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Every day is a nightmare.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> I wake up on this empty station and see things I know should not be there. I don't know if they're real, or hallucinations from the isolation, or if I've ended up infecting myself.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/ccf91f90fa78b9e838111713c8ee6075.poster.avif?t=1759931515\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/ccf91f90fa78b9e838111713c8ee6075.webm?t=1759931515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/ccf91f90fa78b9e838111713c8ee6075.mp4?t=1759931515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is falling apart. A rise of violence and misanthropy ravages the Earth, but your space station is not safe either. Every day you work towards a bio-weapon made to wipe out humanity in the most brutal way possible. Anyone who is contaminated hallucinates demonic entities that torment them until they die. You must finish its development before it kills you. <strong>You must fulfill your purpose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/763861ada559a8ccb64b1288f0526c97.poster.avif?t=1759931515\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/763861ada559a8ccb64b1288f0526c97.webm?t=1759931515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/763861ada559a8ccb64b1288f0526c97.mp4?t=1759931515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the hidden conspiracy driving this apocalypse as you progress; create what will be the end of humanity, and survive the horrors of your own creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/68b974065bb9f54c6045a606563a16ac.avif?t=1759931515\" width=616 height=67 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050580?t=1759931515","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050580?t=1759931515","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/8eab644b4b5ff8b0595f8e0ac4d69993baa0e30d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759931515","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/8eab644b4b5ff8b0595f8e0ac4d69993baa0e30d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759931515","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Every day is a nightmare.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> I wake up on this empty station and see things I know should not be there. I don't know if they're real, or hallucinations from the isolation, or if I've ended up infecting myself.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/ccf91f90fa78b9e838111713c8ee6075.poster.avif?t=1759931515\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/ccf91f90fa78b9e838111713c8ee6075.webm?t=1759931515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/ccf91f90fa78b9e838111713c8ee6075.mp4?t=1759931515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is falling apart. A rise of violence and misanthropy ravages the Earth, but your space station is not safe either. Every day you work towards a bio-weapon made to wipe out humanity in the most brutal way possible. Anyone who is contaminated hallucinates demonic entities that torment them until they die. You must finish its development before it kills you. <strong>You must fulfill your purpose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/763861ada559a8ccb64b1288f0526c97.poster.avif?t=1759931515\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/763861ada559a8ccb64b1288f0526c97.webm?t=1759931515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/763861ada559a8ccb64b1288f0526c97.mp4?t=1759931515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the hidden conspiracy driving this apocalyps